Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Connect to Digilent Discovery 3", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9734482295880833`*^9, 3.9734482389807787`*^9}, {
  3.973449059971982*^9, 
  3.9734490650263643`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2523bd0a-6b7b-4069-bb69-\
92bdcc9e0de9"],

Cell["\<\
Make sure that you have the latest Digilent Waveforms Beta SDK installed. You \
get this from the Digilent Waveforms software download which gives you both \
the Waveforms app to install as well as the option to install the SDK:

https://digilent.com/reference/software/waveforms/waveforms-3/betas?_gl=1*\
de6fev*_ga*MTEwMTYyNzg4NC4xNzc1NTEzNTMy*_ga_35QL6YVFN1*\
czE3NzU1MTM1MzEkbzEkZzEkdDE3NzU1MTM1OTUkajYwJGwwJGgyMTQzMzkyMTI0

On Windows the SDK is installed with Waveforms. On a Mac use the following \
(on Canvas class notes) to help install the SDK Beta:    \
Digilent_SDK_Installation.pdf 

Note that the files DigilentDiscovery.wl and dwf_interface.dylib need to be \
located in the same folder as this Mathematica notebook.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9735148130923977`*^9, 3.973514914084997*^9}, {
