Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Divide the Data in to Two Sets: x1 and y1, and x2 and y2", \
"Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970412737281246*^9, 
  3.970412761023391*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"78970ecf-54d2-46bf-a637-\
9b7cb5c46a8a"],

Cell["\<\
As mentioned above we want to use half the data to generate our models and \
the other half to test those models. We want to avoid testing our models on \
the same data as they were created from because there is always the risk that \
such models will not work as well when used with new data sets.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970412863147892*^9, 
  3.970413009859447*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f52215ce-089c-4c9d-a625-\
1e9267a94b7e"],

