6c654b1c8100"],

Cell["\<\
It takes a long time to plot all the data points, so we have put a screen \
grab image here instead:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9699749500205708`*^9, 3.969975007393609*^9}, {
  3.970413353350284*^9, 3.9704133927097063`*^9}, {3.984490070172984*^9, 
