Cell["\<\
There are so many data points in the plot above that it is difficult to see \
and individual points. We will just plot the first 10,000 x and y \
measurements:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9699749500205708`*^9, 3.969975007393609*^9}, {
  3.970413410134202*^9, 
  3.970413466436551*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2fbf4828-ff07-43db-a1ae-\
b8a13b996e9b"],

