Cell["\<\
The low pass nature of our Black Box is evident here. Clearly high \
frequencies in the input appear to be attenuated. The Black Box looks as \
though it is low pass.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9704135074864607`*^9, 
  3.97041360347936*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bb8c493f-9f2f-4454-bfaa-\
7195479fcdf7"]
}, Open  ]],

