Cell["We can see that the output is remarkably Gaussian.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970148186351822*^9, 3.9701484270009403`*^9}, {
  3.985858881687209*^9, 
  3.985858882784643*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3df305ca-fc12-46e6-9c77-\
efeb7fd742d1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Input and Output Signal Auto-Correlation Functions", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898231551023436*^9, 3.898231560285425*^9}, {
   3.925130408009362*^9, 3.925130411048873*^9}, {3.969898769902563*^9, 
   3.969898772739541*^9}, {3.9699821931579027`*^9, 3.969982205442338*^9}, 
   3.969982257456036*^9, {3.969989527188999*^9, 
   3.969989528541078*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f2ea8de6-8fd7-487f-aad0-\
ecf3d2151239"],

Cell["\<\
Mathematica provides two methods to compute the auto-correlation function, \
called CorrelationFunction[] and ListCorrelate[].
CorrelationFunction[] returns a normalized auto-correlation function (the \
\[Tau]=0 term =1). We do not want this for subsequent system ID. Also \
CorrelationFunction[] is rather slow (\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]brute force\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] method) which does not exploit the FFT algorithm and \
furthermore cannot be used to compute the cross-correlation function which we \
need for system ID.
ListCorrelate[] returns the un-normalized auto- and cross-correlation \
functions and exploits the FFT algorithm which is very fast and essential for \
large values of n. It is best used when n is a power of 2 (as here) in order \
to fully exploit the benefits of the FFT approach.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898675680866536*^9, 3.898676046816991*^9}, 
   3.970231022255645*^9},ExpressionUUID->"6003e3fa-03f2-4297-9fff-\
d0fa1054a503"],

Cell["\<\
We can see that the input auto-correlation function is that of a white noise \
signal.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898232132621766*^9, 
  3.898232175016461*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b6adfd79-8ed9-49f3-810c-\
7c0c2d0bbb1d"],

Cell["\<\
When we use ListCorrelate we need to extract the m+1 values we want and \
divide by n to get biased Auto-Covariance Function values. 
Note that we could divide each correlation function value by n-k (where is \
the lag index) to give the unbiased estimate. However the unbiased estimate \
has larger estimation error than the biased estimate particularly for higher \
values of k.
In the following we show the effect of varying the length of the \
auto-correlation function:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898245784133186*^9, 3.8982460235299597`*^9}, {
  3.898676091666884*^9, 3.898676129073004*^9}, {3.898676163226893*^9, 
  3.8986763237861*^9}, {3.969897636798201*^9, 
  3.969897663950013*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"22886547-6abd-429f-a546-\
184af7052541"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  ButtonBox["\<\"\[GraySquare]\"\>",
   Appearance->"Frameless",
   ButtonFunction:>(SelectionMove[
      EvaluationCell[], All, TextLine]; SelectionEvaluate[
      EvaluationNotebook[]]),
   Evaluator->Automatic,
   Method->"Preemptive"], ";", "  ", 
  RowBox[{"m", "=", "2000"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Tau]i", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
    RowBox[{"0.0", ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"m", "-", "1"}], ")"}], " ", "\[CapitalDelta]t"}], ",", 
     "\[CapitalDelta]t"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"cxx", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ListCorrelate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x1", ",", "x1", ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", 
      RowBox[{"n", ";;", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "m", "-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "/", "n"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"cyy", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ListCorrelate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"y1", ",", "y1", ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", 
      RowBox[{"n", ";;", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "m", "-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "/", "n"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"cxx", "=", 
    FractionBox["cxx", 
     RowBox[{"cxx", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]]}], ";"}], " ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"we", " ", "normalize", " ", "the", " ", "auto"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{
    "correlation", " ", "function", " ", "so", " ", "that", " ", "it", " ", 
     "starts", " ", "at", " ", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"cyy", "=", 
    FractionBox["cyy", 
     RowBox[{"cyy", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]]}], ";"}], " ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"we", " ", "normalize", " ", "the", " ", "auto"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{
    "correlation", " ", "function", " ", "so", " ", "that", " ", "it", " ", 
     "starts", " ", "at", " ", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Tau]i", ",", "cxx"}], "}"}], "\[Transpose]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Tau]i", ",", "cyy"}], "}"}], "\[Transpose]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", "All"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"PlotStyle", "->", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"Blue", ",", "Red"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotTheme", "->", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Scientific\>\"", ",", "\"\<Grid\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLabel", "->", 
    RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Input (Blue) and Output (Red) Auto-Correlation \
Functions\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"FontFamily", "->", "\"\<Times\>\""}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"FontSize", "->", "16"}], ",", "Bold", ",", "Black"}], "]"}]}], 
   ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Lag (s)\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"FontFamily", "->", "\"\<Times\>\""}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"FontSize", "->", "16"}], ",", "Bold", ",", "Black"}], "]"}], 
      ",", 
      RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Relative Correlation\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"FontFamily", "->", "\"\<Times\>\""}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"FontSize", "->", "16"}], ",", "Bold", ",", "Black"}], 
       "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"LabelStyle", "->", 
    RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Black", ",", 
      RowBox[{"FontFamily", "->", "\"\<Times\>\""}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"FontSize", "->", "14"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "500"}]}], 
  "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898244861889445*^9, 3.898244918386804*^9}, {
