Cell["\<\
There are too many data points to plot so we will plot a small portion of the \
predicted output, ynp, and the measured output, y:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970150778855215*^9, 3.9701508190049887`*^9}, 
   3.97016328092325*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ab113bd0-29bd-408b-b833-\
