Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Analysis of Non-Parametric Model Residuals", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970765830727051*^9, 3.9707658365798073`*^9}, {
  3.970767544972872*^9, 3.970767549457241*^9}, {3.9707677194499598`*^9, 
  3.9707677203369827`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ce09d905-0174-4fe5-ab1a-\
db778dafabce"],

Cell["\<\
It is useful to look at the properties of the non-parametric model residuals. \
The residuals  are a combination of un-modeled linear and non-linear \
dynamics, measurement noise,  etc.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970765844410296*^9, 3.9707659882032623`*^9}, {
  3.970767650228163*^9, 3.970767676055283*^9}, {3.970767723800145*^9, 
