Cell["\<\
Lets look at the fit over the range of frequencies (e.g., 10 Hz to 20 kHz \
(i.e., the audio range)) for which the coherence squared function values are \
reasonably high:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9701571609645853`*^9, 3.970157263521634*^9}, {
  3.970414960457551*^9, 
  3.9704149631288424`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0f88239c-421f-4cdd-8442-\
5be277ccb407"],

