Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Fit a Parametric Model Using Nonlinear Minimization", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898342327066298*^9, 3.898342332373768*^9}, {
  3.970162000560672*^9, 
  3.970162001920245*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8b5fec4b-0f3a-4882-b9f7-\
5e60903da623"],

Cell["\<\
The estimated system impulse response function is a nonparametric model with \
no restriction on model order. We now want to fit a second-order model by \
minimizing the sum of squared differences between the nonparametric and \
parametric models:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.898342339308233*^9, 3.898342401930043*^9}, {
  3.898342464211331*^9, 
  3.89834250170916*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"36fd3a90-3cfa-4fa2-b622-\
3499c571a903"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For an equation of this complexity it is unlikely that a direct or analytic \
approach may be taken to estimate the \"best fit\" parameters. We therefore \
will use iterative method to estimate the parameters which minimize the least \
squares objective function. Because our equation has nonlinear terms in it, \
we need to use what is called a ",
 StyleBox["nonlinear minimization",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " technique. Mathematica possess some very sophisticated nonlinear \
minimization techniques. We will use a very powerful technique called the \
Levenberg-Marquardt nonlinear minimization algorithm which is one of a number \
available in Mathematica's NonlinearModelFit function. In order to help the \
nonlinear minimization method achieve its goal of finding the parameters \
which minimize the objective function we need to supply some initial \
parameter estimates (\[Alpha]\[Alpha]\[Alpha], \[Zeta]\[Zeta]\[Zeta], \
\[Omega]\[Omega]\[Omega]) obtained from the fit we did by hand above:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.773058018228601*^9, 3.773058872852546*^9}, 
   3.773059089493124*^9, {3.773061171398417*^9, 3.773061174638664*^9}, {
   3.7730612445979557`*^9, 3.7730613206292048`*^9}, {3.77306152548997*^9, 
   3.773061546245829*^9}, 3.773061630121024*^9, {3.773099788856045*^9, 
   3.773099850093455*^9}, {3.8987796270767207`*^9, 3.898779635782593*^9}, {
   3.898889009560723*^9, 3.8988890161578627`*^9}, {3.9222662451646175`*^9, 
   3.9222662507388077`*^9}, {3.970162033975627*^9, 3.970162053370783*^9}, {
   3.9702218077958517`*^9, 
   3.970221808856564*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ed3be63d-e7c9-4d9d-b27f-\
f5d7d10b2d8d"],

