Cell["\<\
As we can see the fit is remarkably good. We have reduced the number of \
parameters in our models from the non-parametric model: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9701628879001923`*^9, 3.9701629274243603`*^9}, {
  3.970162968001216*^9, 
  3.970162977870099*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d1400981-0c9d-4f6f-a7b9-\
