to the 3 parameters, \[Alpha], \[Omega], and \[Zeta] of out parametric \
second-order model.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9701629582649097`*^9, 3.9701631136249523`*^9}, 
   3.9701634066148643`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"31309118-2e50-46fd-a2ef-\
