Cell["\<\
So we can see that the static gain parameter, \[Alpha], is important but we \
do not lose much by setting it to be 2.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971117607622867*^9, 
  3.971117661595333*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"44aef373-6f66-472a-bc4b-\
09921b03c719"]
}, Open  ]],

