Cell["\<\
So we can see that the damping parameter, \[Zeta], is important and fairly \
sharp degradation in the SS as we move away from the optimal value. Lets zoom \
in on the optimal value:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971117607622867*^9, 3.971117661595333*^9}, {
  3.971118256021244*^9, 
  3.971118350761746*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"03464a6c-839d-4a82-b568-\
1e56e317c572"],

