Cell["\<\
So we can see that the natural frequency parameter, \[Omega], is important \
and fairly sharp degradation in the SS as we move away from the optimal \
value. Lets zoom in on the optimal value:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971117607622867*^9, 3.971117661595333*^9}, {
  3.971118256021244*^9, 3.971118350761746*^9}, {3.9711203043263807`*^9, 
  3.9711203149390574`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9cc7b506-54b3-43a1-aac7-\
6c689556daf3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
