  3.794933929880843*^9},ExpressionUUID->"dfc4df50-47f0-43b5-925f-\
69916269d643"],

Cell["\<\
where Z1, Z2, Z3 and Z4 can each be any parallel or series combination of \
resistors, capacitors and inductors. By choosing what Z1, Z2, Z3, and Z4 are \
we can design a variety of second-order filters (low-pass, high-pass, \
band-pass and band-stop).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.795810965516138*^9, 3.7958110144354897`*^9}, {
  3.795811048538494*^9, 
  3.795811130623917*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bf867a93-9cf4-433f-aafc-\
8f04aaa39596"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "From ",
 ButtonBox["https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/Sallen-Key_\
Generic _Circuit.svg",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/Sallen-Key_\
Generic_Circuit.svg"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/Sallen-Key_Generic_\
Circuit.svg"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.794933941585328*^9, 
  3.794933970950545*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"21dc8413-2edd-4725-bfb0-\
fbb4f9a31b3a"],

Cell["The general transfer function is:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.794933838472897*^9, 3.794933850328764*^9}, {
  3.7958110191088653`*^9, 
  3.795811031252484*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"37cb5981-037d-4f40-8cb3-\
62aab63f5c38"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"tf", "[", "s_", "]"}], ":=", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"z3", "[", "s", "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"z4", "[", "s", "]"}]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"z1", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"z2", "[", "s", "]"}]}], " ", "+", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"z3", "[", "s", "]"}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"z1", "[", "s", "]"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"z2", "[", "s", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"z3", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"z4", "[", "s", "]"}]}]}]]}], "\n"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.794933436496151*^9, 3.794933513012993*^9}, {
   3.7949335491461353`*^9, 3.794933612080341*^9}, 3.794933874712912*^9, 
   3.794934357249836*^9, 3.794946497236697*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[24]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b5b88ebf-45df-45f4-b1af-e60c4ee9e326"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"tf", "[", "s", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7949465284342775`*^9, 3.794946530150674*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[25]:=",ExpressionUUID->"bdcd37ed-563e-4b0c-a17b-328ede85ce8b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"z3", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", 
   RowBox[{"z4", "[", "s", "]"}]}], 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"z1", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"z2", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"z1", "[", "s", "]"}], "+", 
      RowBox[{"z2", "[", "s", "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"z3", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"z3", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"z4", "[", "s", "]"}]}]}]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9191595798297157`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[25]=",ExpressionUUID->"04142001-1761-ce4e-9d22-eabaef0041a6"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Low-pass Filter", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.794934366658835*^9, 
  3.794934378254829*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a6cdcfb3-57dc-4b96-b56a-\
744d7045d262"],

Cell["\<\
For the case of a second-order, low-pass, filter where we want to have a \
specified static gain and a specified damping parameter we need to add a few \
more components:\
\>", "Text",
